WEBVTT

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:10.480
Hi, this is Shirzad.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:17.909
Please sit comfortably with your spine
straight and relaxed, your head straight,

00:00:17.909 --> 00:00:21.720
your chest open,
your feet flat on the floor.

00:00:23.360 --> 00:00:25.640
Please close your eyes when you're ready.

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:30.520
Now do some reps with your sense of touch.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:37.136
Rub two fingertips gently against each
other with such attention that you can

00:00:37.136 --> 00:00:40.440
feel the fingertip ridges on both fingers.

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:10.314
Now rub all the fingertips of one hand
gently against the fingertips and palm of

00:01:10.314 --> 00:01:14.400
the other hand,
and notice all those sensations.

00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:41.624
Now put your right hand on your stomach
and notice the gentle rising and falling

00:01:41.624 --> 00:01:44.160
of your stomach with each breath.

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:08.920
Take your time and whenever you feel
ready, open your eyes.
